# FWPIN (rmbp-ledger B455) — SHA-256 pins for the BCM4331 b43 firmware set (wifi/firmware.rs).
# NO FIRMWARE BYTES live in this tree (CLEAN_ROOM_POLICY §4). Each row is a fact ABOUT a file in Peter's
# bunker: `<role> <64 lowercase hex>`, roles ucode / initvals / bsinitvals. The kernel stages ONLY a file
# whose SHA-256 equals its role's row; with no row it refuses with reason=unpinned and prints the digest.
# The rows come from arroyo's WIFI-FW build line (`⚡ WIFI-FW: <file> sha256=…`) — never typed from memory.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
